passwords/
*.key
*.pem
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*.age
secrets.nix

# Nix build results
.result
result
result-*

# Editor / tooling
.direnv/
*.swp
*~

# Local maintainer runbooks (not for the public repo)
RELEASING.md
RESTORE.md
